                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Twice, I was told I had breast cancer. Twice, my family and friends felt the impact of my diagnosis. Twice, because of the support of my doctors and loved ones, I survived.\n\nCancer impacts the lives of every single American. Together, we can end cancer as we know it.",
