                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "October is #BreastCancerAwarenessMonth.\n\nAs a two-time survivor, I remember how scary it was to first learn of my diagnosis. Join me in honoring survivors, researchers, doctors, caregivers, those fighting, and those we've lost.\n\nYou are in my heart. \ud83e\ude77",
