                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a two-time breast cancer survivor, I know just how critical immediate access to care is following a diagnosis. That's why I am a proud cosponsor of @RepGarbarino & @USRepKCastor's #MetastaticBreastCancerAccesstoCareAct, which will waive Medicare and SSDI waiting periods.",
